# RakshaCall runs with ZERO environment variables by default.
#
# The detection engine is a fully local, deterministic pattern-matching
# system (src/lib/detectionEngine.ts) — no API key, no paid service, and no
# network call is required for the app to work end to end.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder/extension point for future, genuinely
# optional enhancements (e.g. swapping in a hosted speech-to-text service,
# or an opt-in AI classifier). Nothing in the current MVP reads any of these.
#
# VITE_ENABLE_EXPERIMENTAL_AI_CLASSIFIER=false
